Text: Similarly, the work [2] proposed a model that made use of the political ideologies of users, bot likelihood, and activity-related account metadata to predict users who spread the trolls’ contents. 3 Data To model the identiﬁcation process of the Russian trolls, we considered a large dataset of both regular users (legitimate accounts) and IRA troll accounts.

